Bool: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 1 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..1, free 0 below / 254 above

Rank: size 1, align 1, stride 1, tag word at 0, payload at 0, scalar of 2 bits, niche at 0 width 1, valid 0..2, free 0 below / 253 above

Pick: size 2, align 2, stride 2, tag at bits 8..8 of 2 bytes, payload at 0, niche at 0 width 2, valid 0..511, free 0 below / 65024 above

Level: size 2, align 2, stride 2, tag at bits 8..9 of 2 bytes, payload at 0, niche at 0 width 2, valid 0..1023, free 0 below / 64512 above

Span: size 4, align 4, stride 4, tag at bits 16..16 of 4 bytes, payload at 0, niche at 0 width 4, valid 0..131071, free 0 below / 4294836224 above

Board: size 4, align 2, stride 4, niche at 0 width 2, valid 0..511, free 0 below / 65024 above
